@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5251

### 1. Haal een dev-token op (alleen Development). Andere testaccounts: zie Data/Seed/DevDataSeeder.cs
# @name devToken
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "analist@soc.local" }

###
@token = {{devToken.response.body.$.token}}

### 2. Wie ben ik?
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/dev/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Alert promoveren tot case (US-08)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/alerts/1/promote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
